{"id":"G1401","lemma":"δοῦλος","transliteration":"doulos","sayIt":"doulos","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"noun","gloss":"slave","meaning":"δοῦλος, -η, -ον,\n[in LXX, ὁ δ. nearly always for עֶבֶד; ὁ δ. chiefly for שִׁפְחָה ,אָמָה ;]\n1. in bondage to, subject to: Rom.6:19.\n2. As subst., ὁ, ἡ δ., a slave;\n(a) fem., ἡ δ., a female slave, bondmaid (Cremer, 702; DB, iii, 215): Luk.1:38, 48 Act.2:18\" (LXX) ;\n(b) masc., ὁ δ., a slave, bond-man: Mat.8:9 18:23, al.; opposite to ἐλεύθερος, 1Co.7:22 12:13, Gal.3:28, Eph.6:8, Col.3:11, Rev.6:15 13:16 19:18; opposite to κύριος, δεσπότης, οἰκοδεσπότης, Mat.10:24 13:27, 28 Luk.12:46, Jhn.15:15, Eph.6:5, Col.3:22 4:1, al.; metaphorically, δ. Χριστοῦ, τοῦ Χρ., Ἰησοῦ Χρ., Rom.1:1, 1Co.7:22, Gal.1:10, Eph.6:6, Php.1:1, Col.4:12, Jas.1:1, 2Pe.1:1, Ju 1; δ. τ. θεοῦ, τ. κυρίου, Act.16:17, 2Ti.2:24, Tit.1:1, 1Pe.2:16, Rev.7:3 15:3; δ. πονηρός, ἀχρεῖος, κακός, Mat.18:32 24:48 25:26, 30, Luk.17:10 19:22; δ. ἁμαρτίας, Jhn.8:34, Rom.6:17, 20; τ. φθορᾶς, 2Pe.2:19.\nSYN.: διάκονος (q.V.), θεράπων, ὐπηρέτης (see DB, iii, 377; iv, 461, 469; DCG, i, 221; ii, 613; Cremer, 215, 702). (AS)","glosses":["servant","servants","slave","slaves","menservants","servants of"],"count":120,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-8","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"servant","kjv":"servant"}},{"chapterId":"mat-10","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"a servant","kjv":"the servant"}},{"chapterId":"mat-10","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"servant","kjv":"the servant"}},{"chapterId":"mat-13","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"servants","kjv":"the servants"}},{"chapterId":"mat-13","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"the servants","kjv":"he servants"}},{"chapterId":"mat-18","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"servants"}},{"chapterId":"mat-18","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"servant","kjv":"The servant"}},{"chapterId":"mat-18","v":27,"renderings":{"kjv":"servant"}},{"chapterId":"mat-18","v":28,"renderings":{"bsb":"servant","kjv":"servant"}},{"chapterId":"mat-18","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"servant","kjv":"servant"